  (text "CV outputs: two MCP4822 (internal 2.048 V reference, gain 1x) and unity buffers" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f0ca1072-1ad0-5f8d-8fda-07e89954c0ca"))
  (text "CV = (0, , 2.048) V, 1 V/oct, MIDI note 24 = 0 V, note 36 = 1 V, note 48 = 2 V; higher notes saturate (ARCHITECTURE.md, CV Circuit)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 172.72 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f95d495d-905c-5d65-9e3e-75a994936df8"))
  (text "The DACs run from +3V3, so only the default gain 1x is possible: -DREBIRTH_CV_DAC_GAIN=2 (0-4.096 V) would need the DACs on" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 172.72 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "344d2002-49fc-5b99-b99f-481ed92f38d5"))
  (text "VBUS and 3.3 V -> 5 V buffers on DAC_SCK/DAC_MOSI/DAC_CSx_N. The buffers already run from VBUS and have the headroom." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 172.72 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "72523402-f05c-524c-80bf-8aaeb6805bf2"))
  (text "CV 1" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 156.21 64.135 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524) (thickness 0.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e08a62c3-cc42-5b07-bc42-a05fd8297fdd"))
  (text "CV 2" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 156.21 92.075 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524) (thickness 0.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0aada417-f926-5efb-9ddd-6c0decc01854"))
  (text "CV 3" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 156.21 127.635 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524) (thickness 0.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f36faa53-224a-5196-874d-3ddaebf19370"))
  (text "CV 4" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 156.21 155.575 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524) (thickness 0.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8c8ad82c-d2a2-5008-bfd6-7f46dfb2593a"))
  (text "U503 MCP6004 (rail-to-rail, VBUS): unity gain at DC. R511-R514 (1 k)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 172.72 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "363716e2-c802-5dfe-86e6-8a8f816a255f"))
  (text "sit inside the loop: R521-R524 (10 k) take the feedback from the jack" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 172.72 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "93552d0a-1f99-5a4b-99d1-2c32b87e3e31"))
  (text "side, C511-C514 (100 pF) close the loop at high frequency, so cable capacitance and" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 172.72 55.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "68eaab97-d52e-5060-b11a-a96974949cfe"))
  (text "a short cannot upset the stage and the load does not shift the pitch." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 172.72 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "aeab76e1-a078-57ab-846f-82a4b585b037"))
  (text "Near 0 V the output stays ~25 mV above ground (MCP6004 swing):" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 172.72 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fbc6be19-a086-5b16-876c-9b5e92f6c727"))
  (text "notes below 24 + 1 cent read slightly sharp; calibrate on the bench." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 172.72 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "25d236a5-2998-566c-a13e-5c1eccdbd19c"))
